# Judge1-14-1

@HideUI UINames:ControlPanel AllowToggle:false
@ShowUI UINames:DebateUI

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:晚餐之后，<br>我随便到处转了转。<br>详情我忘了。<br>就是到处转了转。<br>我知道这很可疑，但我也只能说，<br>请大家相信我。|#0101Trial14_Leia001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……这个听无数遍了，<br>你快接着说吧。|#0101Trial14_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,Arms,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:嗯，好啊。|#0101Trial14_Leia002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:65,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……那之后，<br>我为了参加直播，<br>前往可可所在的<br>会客厅。|#0101Trial14_Leia003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:记得你好像<br>掐着时间才到的？<br>……好像是喘着大气<br>跑过来的～<br>而且比我想像的<br>还要重视直播的事……|#0101Trial14_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:33,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1,ArmR6,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:哎呀！？<br>难不成<br>你这家伙<br>其实是好人……！？|#0101Trial14_Coco002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:33,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,ArmR8,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……看来误会很大啊。<br>我感觉<br>我的合作精神<br>应该比你强。|#0101Trial14_Leia004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:65,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:哈！？<br>别把人<br>当社交障碍<br>好吗！|#0101Trial14_Coco003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1,ArmR9,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:啊哈哈……<br>说来那时<br>你是不是还勉强自己<br>表演了一下<br>杂技来着？<br>直播回放<br>应该有拍到吧。|#0101Trial14_Miria001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:就这样我们<br>结束了直播，<br>回到了各自的房间。<br>在那之前我们三个<br>稍微聊了聊，对不对？|#0101Trial14_Leia005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:31,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:嗯嗯。<br>因为没有时间了，<br>那边的龙套就说她来收拾，<br>来着～<br>直播结束的反省会？<br>之类的？|#0101Trial14_Coco004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR9,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我很擅长做杂务哦。<br>收拾全是我一个人做的。<br>说来那时<br>你们两个人的关系<br>稍微有点<br>好转了欸。|#0101Trial14_Miria002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:33,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:然后那之后……<br>我们三个人<br>路过了诺亚的房间。<br>刚刚也说过了，<br>我们什么都没看见，<br>什么都没听见。|#0101Trial14_Leia006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:然后到早上为止，<br>我都和同一间房的<br>米莉亚待在一起。<br>……顺便问下米莉亚你，<br>我当时<br>有做什么<br>可疑的行动吗？|#0101Trial14_Leia007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Glare_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:没有吧……我觉得？<br>记得你很快就<br>上床睡觉了。<br>当时很安静，<br>如果有什么异状，<br>我想我会察觉到啦……|#0101Trial14_Miria003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:31,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:然后到了早上，<br>听见发现尸体的<br>安安的惨叫，<br>我就醒过来了。<br>接着我马上起床，<br>赶到了现场。|#0101Trial14_Leia008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……怎么样？<br>说明到此结束……|#0101Trial14_Leia009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"找到我是凶手的<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_14_01\">证据</link>了吗？<br>有证据的话，<br>就请你拿出来吧。|#0101Trial14_Leia010|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1,ArmR5,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:……前提是，<br>如果真的<br>存在证据。|#0101Trial14_Leia011| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

